---
description: Prepare one maintainUseRegister evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ClearanceTask[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Record approved uses, required attribution, expiry, and downstream distribution. Recheck conditions before release, schedule removals or renewals where needed, and propagate consent changes to affected derivatives and public surfaces. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
